+## Code mode
+
+Instead of one tool call per turn, an agent can write a short script. For the providers of the WorkPilot loop, `run_script` runs one JavaScript script under Node (no `process`, `require`, `fetch` or `eval`) and every call it makes goes back through the same tool checks as a direct call. For a Claude task, in its worktree and in the agent terminals, Claude Code's own REPL can be turned on. Off by default; Settings offers off, auto or on, and a task or a single phase can choose. Design: [code-mode.md](https://github.com/krovomi/WorkPilot-AI/blob/develop/docs/architecture/code-mode.md).
